"computers/extracted-outputs/313e4743-0.svg)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Note that the `CXGate` objects have been decomposed to `ecr` gates and "
"single-qubit basis gates.\n"
msgstr ""

